# 从 GitHub 复验三种安装方式（都在临时目录里，不碰用户自己的配置）
$ claude plugin marketplace add dososo/blcaptain-measure-cjk   # CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=<tmp>/claude
Cleaning up old marketplace cache…
✔ Successfully added marketplace: blcaptain-measure-cjk (declared in user settings)
# 退出码：0
$ claude plugin install measure@blcaptain-measure-cjk
Installing plugin "measure@blcaptain-measure-cjk"...✔ Successfully installed plugin: measure@blcaptain-measure-cjk (scope: user)
# 退出码：0
$ claude plugin list
Installed plugins:

  ❯ measure@blcaptain-measure-cjk
    Version: 0.1.0
    Scope: user
    Status: ✔ enabled
    Note: The packages it lists were not installed, because its package-lock.json entry ”node_modules/measure-cjk” is a folder link or a bundled copy


$ codex plugin marketplace add dososo/blcaptain-measure-cjk   # CODEX_HOME=<tmp>/codex
Added marketplace `blcaptain-measure-cjk` from https://github.com/dososo/blcaptain-measure-cjk.git.
Installed marketplace root: <tmp>/codex/.tmp/marketplaces/blcaptain-measure-cjk
# 退出码：0
$ codex plugin add measure@blcaptain-measure-cjk
Added plugin `measure` from marketplace `blcaptain-measure-cjk`.
Installed plugin root: <tmp>/codex/plugins/cache/blcaptain-measure-cjk/measure/0.1.0
# 退出码：0
SKILL.md：<tmp>/codex/.tmp/marketplaces/blcaptain-measure-cjk/skills/measure/SKILL.md

$ npx -y skills@1.7.4 add dososo/blcaptain-measure-cjk -s measure -a claude-code -a codex -y   # 在 <tmp>/proj 里
